    <description>Autolaunched flow that posts a goods receipt. Validates the receipt and its lines, then calls GoodsReceiptService, which atomically updates stock, creates inventory transactions, updates purchase order lines and status, and marks the receipt Posted (all-or-nothing). Posted receipts are rejected to prevent duplicate posting.</description>
